WEBVTT

00:17:28.207 --> 00:17:32.391
tokom budućih nekoliko decenija.

00:17:32.391 --> 00:17:35.043
Da zaključim,
došao sam do uverenja

00:17:35.043 --> 00:17:37.281
da su sastojci sledećih Panteona

00:17:37.281 --> 00:17:38.668
svuda oko nas,

00:17:38.668 --> 00:17:40.855
a samo čekaju vizionare

00:17:40.855 --> 00:17:42.589
sa širokim znanjem,

00:17:42.589 --> 00:17:44.199
multidisciplinarnim veštinama

00:17:44.199 --> 00:17:46.067
i velikom strašću

00:17:46.067 --> 00:17:51.153
da ih iskoriste
kako bi ostvarili svoje snove.

00:17:51.153 --> 00:17:53.649
Ali ovi ljudi ne nastaju

00:17:53.649 --> 00:17:54.988
samo tako.

00:17:54.988 --> 00:17:56.827
Treba da se neguju i podstiču

00:17:56.827 --> 00:17:58.606
od malih nogu.

00:17:58.606 --> 00:18:00.466
Treba da ih volimo i pomažemo im